    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's go through it line by line. Pay close attention to the grammar and vocabulary.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "guest",
      "t": "Виктория, мне было приятно познакомиться.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Victoria, it was a great pleasure meeting you.' The reflexive ending on the verb for 'to meet' turns the action back onto the subject.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Взаимно. До свидания.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Likewise. Goodbye.' Notice the word order: 'likewise' comes first, and 'meeting' finishes the sentence.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "guest",
      "t": "Приятного вечера.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Have a pleasant evening.' Here 'pleasant' sets up the idea, while 'evening' comes at the end for emphasis. And Vika jumps in.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Какой приятный вечер 0.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What a pleasant evening 0.' Here 'nice' sets up the idea, while 'zero' comes at the end for emphasis.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Какой приятный вечер 1.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What a pleasant evening 1.' You'll hear 'nice' all the time in the show, here connected with 'one'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Какой приятный вечер 2.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What a pleasant evening 2.' In Russian, 'nice' leads into 'two' in a very natural everyday phrasing.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Какой приятный вечер 3.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What a pleasant evening 3.' Russian leaves out 'am', 'is', or 'are' in the present tense, linking 'nice' straight to 'three'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Какой приятный вечер 4.",
      "gap": 0.55
